msgstr ""

msgid "Sumire「............」"
msgstr "Sumire「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Is something wrong?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Pasa algo?」"

msgid "Sumire「Sorry, I'm gonna go cool down...... I＿mean, wash my face.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Perdón, voy a refrescarme......＿digo, a lavarme la cara.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh, I'll......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh, yo......」"

msgid "Sumire「Kyaa!」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡Kyaa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......\"Kyaa\"?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿\"Kyaa\"?」"

msgid "Sumire「D-Dumbass, don't creep up on me like＿that! You're too close! Back up!」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡I-Idiota, no te me acerques así sin＿hacer ruido! ¡Estás muy cerca! ¡Atrás!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, since you were going to the＿restroom, I thought I'd ask you where it＿is.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, como ibas al baño, pensé＿en preguntarte dónde está.」"

msgid "Sumire「I'll tell you later! Just leave me alone＿right now, please.」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡Te lo digo luego! Solo déjame en＿paz ahora mismo, por favor.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Even someone like Big Bro screams＿like a girl.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Hasta alguien como el Hermano＿Mayor grita como chica.」"

msgid "Sumire「S-Shut up! I haven't screamed like that＿since I saw that fuckin' snake......＿Snake? That's it, you look like a snake.」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡C-Cállate! No gritaba así desde que＿vi esa maldita serpiente......＿¿Serpiente? Sí, pareces una serpiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¿Eh?」"

msgid "Sumire「Rrrrgh, it's nothing! We're done here!＿Go home!」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡Grrr, no es nada! ¡Terminamos＿aquí! ¡Vete a casa!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「But where's the bathr--」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pero ¿dónde está el bañ--」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（What's wrong all of a sudden? I really＿don't get her......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¿Qué le pasa de repente? En verdad＿no la entiendo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（For now, I guess I'll go back to＿Luxure...... I'm concerned about Taiga＿and Kitamura.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Por ahora supongo que volveré＿a Luxure...... Me preocupan＿Taiga y Kitamura.）」"

msgid "Sumire「You've sure got an ugly mug, with＿stupid fuckin' snake eyes! T-That's why＿my heart randomly started pounding」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡Qué cara horrible y qué malditos ojos＿de serpiente tienes! P-Por eso mi＿corazón empezó a latir de la nada」"

msgid "Sumire「so hard......」"
msgstr "Sumire「tan fuerte......」"

msgid "Sumire「Shut up! You're a man, so do it on the＿side of the road! Here's your cell phone＿back. Now get out already! Oh, but」"
msgstr "Sumire「¡Cállate! ¡Eres hombre, así que hazlo＿al lado del camino! Toma tu teléfono.＿¡Y lárgate de una vez! Ah, pero」"

msgid "Sumire「don't forget our agreement on the＿morning of the 7th.」"
msgstr "Sumire「no olvides nuestro acuerdo＿para la mañana del 7.」"
